{"3375630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lightkeeper's Curse", "steam_appid": 3375630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lightkeeper’s Curse is a horror puzzle game where you explore a dark, cursed castle using limited light orbs to keep a deadly monster at bay. Solve environmental puzzles, manage your light carefully, and stay out of the shadows...or die in them.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging puzzles: </strong>Solve interconnected environmental puzzles that test logic and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere and sound design: </strong>Dynamic audio and visual cues create a tense, haunting environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light-based survival mechanics: </strong>Use limited light orbs to repel darkness and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story: </strong>Uncover the castle’s tragic past through exploration and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A focused yet fulfilling experience (2–3 hours): </strong>Designed for one or two sittings with no filler content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Dark History</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the era of Dark Alchemists that once inhabited the ruins of Gloamspire Keep, a group of alchemists, filled with hubris and blinded by their own lust for power, sought to create a powerful being that would protect their walls and instill fear in their enemies both near and far. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.poster.avif?t=1760029494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.webm?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.mp4?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive a Cursed Creation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the day of its creation would also be the day of their damnation. Born of their efforts was a powerful being indeed, but with it was born an eternal curse as the being turned against the alchemists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.poster.avif?t=1760029494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.webm?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.mp4?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no recollection as to how or why, you find yourself in the ruined corridors of Gloamspire Keep, centuries later, standing in front of a mysterious glowing orb, a scepter in hand, and no clear direction forward. Find out your role in the story of the Lightkeeper’s Curse as you navigate the ruins of Gloamspire Keep, armed only with light as you solve a series of puzzles under the pressure of looming shadow and darkness that threaten to consume you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lightkeeper’s Curse is a horror puzzle game where you explore a dark, cursed castle using limited light orbs to keep a deadly monster at bay. Solve environmental puzzles, manage your light carefully, and stay out of the shadows...or die in them.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging puzzles: </strong>Solve interconnected environmental puzzles that test logic and observation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive atmosphere and sound design: </strong>Dynamic audio and visual cues create a tense, haunting environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Light-based survival mechanics: </strong>Use limited light orbs to repel darkness and stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating story: </strong>Uncover the castle’s tragic past through exploration and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A focused yet fulfilling experience (2–3 hours): </strong>Designed for one or two sittings with no filler content.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Dark History</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the era of Dark Alchemists that once inhabited the ruins of Gloamspire Keep, a group of alchemists, filled with hubris and blinded by their own lust for power, sought to create a powerful being that would protect their walls and instill fear in their enemies both near and far. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.poster.avif?t=1760029494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.webm?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/411a8be6b8cba30cf925a59f7a785113.mp4?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive a Cursed Creation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, the day of its creation would also be the day of their damnation. Born of their efforts was a powerful being indeed, but with it was born an eternal curse as the being turned against the alchemists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.poster.avif?t=1760029494\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.webm?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3375630/extras/b0bdce90cc983b233dae2692af4dbd56.mp4?t=1760029494\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the Light</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no recollection as to how or why, you find yourself in the ruined corridors of Gloamspire Keep, centuries later, standing in front of a mysterious glowing orb, a scepter in hand, and no clear direction forward. Find out your role in the story of the Lightkeeper’s Curse as you navigate the ruins of Gloamspire Keep, armed only with light as you solve a series of puzzles under the pressure of looming shadow and darkness that threaten to consume you.</p>", "short_description": "Lightkeeper’s Curse is an adventure horror puzzle game that immerses you in the dark mysteries of a ruined keep cursed by shadow. As the Lightkeeper, you are tasked with the burden of navigating the keep to restore the light and escape what lurks in the dark.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - B